<urn:atm:triage:finding/FTQ-016>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "FTQ-016" ;
  triage:title "runtime_composition_failed_startup_returns_to_stopped missing #[serial] — races with daemon_shutdown_signal_install_reuses_shared_flags via static SHARED + INSTALL_LOCK (composition.rs:517)" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm/src/composition.rs:517 — runtime_composition_failed_startup_returns_to_stopped calls start_with_socket_path_for_test() → PreparedRuntimeServer::bind() → LifecycleControlSourceAdapter::install(), touching static SHARED (lifecycle_control.rs:68) and static INSTALL_LOCK (lifecycle_control.rs:69). Test lacks #[serial] attribute. daemon_shutdown_signal_install_reuses_shared_flags (tests.rs:35) IS #[serial] and touches the same statics; parallel execution races. Fix: add #[serial] to runtime_composition_failed_startup_returns_to_stopped. (quality-mgr reported as FTQ-001 in S.3 QA-2 report.)" ;
  triage:category "FTQ" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
